## 3. Optimized Solution — Reverse Permutation

```python
class Solution:
    def minDays(self, s, p):
        n = len(s)

        days = [0] * n

        for i in range(n):
            days[p[i]] = i + 1

        ans = 0

        for i in range(n - 1):
            if s[i] == s[i + 1]:
                ans = max(ans, min(days[i], days[i + 1]))

        return ans
```

**Time Complexity:** O(n)  
**Space Complexity:** O(n)

